      "comment": [
        "Metal at its heaviest! The groove, the sweat, the sex - this is the real deal.",
        "At any pre-teen party, this is the song you're gonna hear. Happy, bubbly and fun.",
        "This latin lover has won the hearts and ears of many an adult woman. A gift of love from Cupid himself.",
        "This is the Hype of the Month according to Zer0 Magazine. This is straight from pop's source, brought to you by guitars galore. No artificial additives.",
